# Outer `end` = length of the inner row; inner `end` = length of grid.
constant grid is list of (list of 1, 2), (list of 3, 4, 5)
change item end of item end of grid to 50
change item end - 1 of item 1 of grid to 10
add 1 to item end of item end of grid
multiply item end of item 1 of grid by 3
say grid
